---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const locale = 'en';
---

<Base title="Terms & Conditions" locale={locale} description="Terms and Conditions of CellPowerX Wellness Center - rules governing the use of our website and services.">

  <section class="page-hero section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="reveal">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content reveal">

        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>These Terms and Conditions govern the use of the CellPowerX Wellness Center website and services. By accessing our website or using our services, you agree to these terms.</p>

        <h2>2. Services</h2>
        <p>CellPowerX Wellness Center offers wellness services: Hydrogen Inhalation, BTA Scan, Infrared Therapy, Electrotherapy, SLM Wave and NanoPulse. These services are wellness-oriented and do not replace professional medical advice.</p>

        <h2>3. Bookings</h2>
        <p>Bookings are subject to availability. CellPowerX reserves the right to change or cancel sessions when necessary, informing the client as early as possible.</p>

        <h2>4. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>The client agrees to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide accurate and up-to-date information</li>
          <li>Inform us of relevant health conditions</li>
          <li>Follow the recommendations of our team</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>CellPowerX Wellness Center does not guarantee specific results. Our services are intended for general well-being and do not replace medical treatment.</p>

        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All website content, including text, images, logos and design, is the property of CellPowerX and is protected by copyright.</p>

        <h2>7. Use of the Website</h2>
        <p>Users agree not to use the website for unlawful or unauthorised purposes, or in any way that could damage, disable or impair its operation.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>CellPowerX may update these terms at any time. Changes take effect once published on the website.</p>

        <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by Portuguese law. Any dispute will be subject to the jurisdiction of the competent courts in Portugal.</p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:geral@int-medicine.com">geral@int-medicine.com</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-top: calc(72px + var(--section-spacing));
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.3125rem);
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--wc-charcoal);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
